@Pdr.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Successful Login (Project Manager)
POST {{Pdr.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pm@company.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### 2. Successful Login (Admin User)
POST {{Pdr.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@company.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### 3. Invalid Credentials Login Test
POST {{Pdr.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pm@company.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword123"
}

### 4. Logout Test
POST {{Pdr.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
